  "description": "Yoon Hara receives a breakup notification over gukbap during lunchtime. \n\nAs if the sudden breakup wasn't sorrowful enough, \nthe guy who vanished without a word has returned after 6 years.    \nA whole 6 years later! \n\n\"Long time no see, Yoon Hara. \n\nHer damned male friend, Baek Jae-eun.    \nReunited Baek Jae-eun was still dazzling and breathtaking. \n\nCompared to herself, a shabby aspiring applicant, he sparkled so much   \nthat she felt as much jealousy as she had missed him. \n\n\"Didn't you miss me?\" \n\nHowever, hearing that deep voice after 6 years made her realize:   \nHer wildly beating heart was telling her it was fine to cross the line right now.    \nAnd that Baek Jae-eun was far too inappropriate to remain just a 'male friend'.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14819016), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285003217)   \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14819023), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285003218)",
